* Delta-Sigma Modulator Imager Sensor Testbench (Baker Fig. 17.36)
.lib "/home/designer/sky130_pdk/libraries/sky130_fd_pr/latest/models/sky130.lib.spice" tt

* W/L parameter definitions matching Fig. 17.36 scaled for SKY130
.param Lmin=0.15u
.param W_cup=2.5u    L_cup=0.5u
.param W_bucket=25u  L_bucket=0.5u
.param W_cm=1.0u     L_cm=1.0u
.param W_p=2.0u      L_p=0.15u
